What is the time complexity of this loop?
i = 1;
while (i < n) i = i * 2;

What is the time complexity?
for (i = 1; i <= n; i++)
  for (j = 1; j <= i; j++)
    count++;

What is the time complexity?
for (i = 1; i <= n; i++)
  for (j = 1; j < n; j = j * 2)
    count++;

What is the time complexity?
for (i = n; i > 0; i = i / 2)
  for (j = 0; j < i; j++)
    count++;

What is the time complexity?
for (i = 0; i < n; i++)
  for (j = 0; j < n; j++)
    c[i][j] = 0;

What is the time complexity?
for (i = 0; i < n; i++)
  for (j = 0; j < 10; j++)
    s++;

What is the time complexity?
for (i = 0; i < n; i++) s++;
for (j = 0; j < n; j++) s++;

For n = 4, how many times does count++ run?
for (i = 0; i < n; i++)
  for (j = i; j < n; j++)
    count++;

